{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13496","headline":"西河郡太原守张夫人挽歌 · 李岑","name":"西河郡太原守张夫人挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹊印庆仍传，鱼轩宠莫先。\n从夫元凯贵，训子孟轲贤。\n龙是双归日，鸾非独舞年。\n哀荣今共尽，凄怆杜陵田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李岑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}